# Third-party skills are fetched by `bunosh skills:update` from the repos listed
# in skills.yaml, pinned in skills.lock.json. They are not redistributed here —
# patch them upstream, in the repo that owns them.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/skills.yaml
!/skills.lock.json
!/testeiya/

# Generated Testomat.io documentation cache (`bunosh docs:update`). SKILL.md and
# docs.lock.json stay tracked: one is authored, the other pins the commit.
/testeiya/testomatio-docs/docs/
/testeiya/testomatio-docs/INDEX.md
